Accelerated Decay for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Accelerated Decay 26.3.0.1 by ErrorMikey.
Original source: https://github.com/ErrorMikey/AcceleratedDecay
Original licence: GPL-3.0-only

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). The icon (icon.png) is the port's own.
This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (GPL-3.0-only); the licence text
is in LICENSE.
